# Claude Code plugins overlay for the `server-headless` profile.
# Active on hosts where profile_tag == server-headless (e.g. linuxbro, superbro).
#
# Format (same as plugins.list):
#   plugin-name@marketplace=marketplace-source
#
# Disable a plugin enabled by the base plugins.list with:
#   !plugin-name@marketplace
#
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Blank lines ignored.

# --- examples (commented out — uncomment as needed) ---
# Disable dev-only plugins inherited from the base list:
# !frontend-design@anthropic-skills
# !plannotator@cbrostrom-plugins

# Add server-only plugins:
# observability-mcp@my-marketplace=cbrostrom/my-marketplace
